arguments.prompt:
You are implementing a Blazor Web App for a logistics company that tracks shipments. The project has already been scaffolded at `/tmp/sv-ccd133d44bab46ceb82e9a4c245619ba/ShipmentTracker/` using `dotnet new blazor -int Auto -ai -au Individual`.

The project structure:
- `ShipmentTracker/` - Server project (hosts app, APIs, EF Core)
- `ShipmentTracker.Client/` - Client project (all interactive UI components)

**Architecture rules for Auto Global mode:**
- All interactive components/pages go in the `.Client` project
- Components cannot access DbContext directly — must use HTTP APIs
- Define service interfaces in `.Client`, implement with HttpClient there
- Server implements same interface with direct DB access
- Both Program.cs files register matching services
- No `@rendermode` needed on pages (global mode handles it)

## What to implement:

### 1. Remove template pages
Delete these files from `ShipmentTracker.Client/Pages/`:
- `Counter.razor`
- `Weather.razor`

### 2. Create shared model in Client project

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Models/Shipment.cs`:
```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public class Shipment
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Description { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }
    public DateTime CreatedAt { get; set; }
    public DateTime? EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public string CustomerEmail { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}

public enum ShipmentStatus
{
    Pending,
    PickedUp,
    InTransit,
    OutForDelivery,
    Delivered,
    Delayed
}
```

### 3. Create service interface in Client project

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/IShipmentService.cs`:
```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public interface IShipmentService
{
    Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync();
    Task<Shipment?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber);
    Task<Shipment?> UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus);
}
```

### 4. Create Client-side implementation (uses HttpClient)

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/ShipmentServiceClient.cs`:
```csharp
using System.Net.Http.Json;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public class ShipmentServiceClient(HttpClient http) : IShipmentService
{
    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        return await http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<Shipment>>("api/shipments") ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        var response = await http.GetAsync($"api/shipments/track/{trackingNumber}");
        if (!response.IsSuccessStatusCode) return null;
        return await response.Content.ReadFromJsonAsync<Shipment>();
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus)
    {
        var response = await http.PutAsJsonAsync($"api/shipments/{id}/status", newStatus);
        if (!response.IsSuccessStatusCode) return null;
        return await response.Content.ReadFromJsonAsync<Shipment>();
    }
}
```

### 5. Register HttpClient and services in Client Program.cs

Edit `ShipmentTracker.Client/Program.cs` to:
```csharp
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebAssembly.Hosting;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

var builder = WebAssemblyHostBuilder.CreateDefault(args);

builder.Services.AddAuthorizationCore();
builder.Services.AddCascadingAuthenticationState();
builder.Services.AddAuthenticationStateDeserialization();

builder.Services.AddHttpClient("ServerAPI", client =>
    client.BaseAddress = new Uri(builder.HostEnvironment.BaseAddress));
builder.Services.AddScoped(sp => sp.GetRequiredService<IHttpClientFactory>().CreateClient("ServerAPI"));
builder.Services.AddScoped<IShipmentService, ShipmentServiceClient>();

await builder.Build().RunAsync();
```

### 6. Create Server-side service implementation

Create `ShipmentTracker/Services/ShipmentServiceServer.cs`:
```csharp
using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;
using ShipmentTracker.Data;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Services;

public class ShipmentServiceServer(IServiceProvider serviceProvider) : IShipmentService
{
    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        using var scope = serviceProvider.CreateScope();
        var db = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<ApplicationDbContext>();
        return await db.Shipments.OrderByDescending(s => s.CreatedAt).ToListAsync();
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        using var scope = serviceProvider.CreateScope();
        var db = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<ApplicationDbContext>();
        return await db.Shipments.FirstOrDefaultAsync(s => s.TrackingNumber == trackingNumber);
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus)
    {
        using var scope = serviceProvider.CreateScope();
        var db = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<ApplicationDbContext>();
        var shipment = await db.Shipments.FindAsync(id);
        if (shipment is null) return null;
        shipment.Status = newStatus;
        await db.SaveChangesAsync();
        return shipment;
    }
}
```

### 7. Add Shipment DbSet to ApplicationDbContext

The existing file is at `ShipmentTracker/Data/ApplicationDbContext.cs`. Add:
```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;
```
And inside the class:
```csharp
public DbSet<Shipment> Shipments => Set<Shipment>();
```

### 8. Update Server Program.cs

Add these to the server `Program.cs`:
- `using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;`
- `using ShipmentTracker.Services;`
- `using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;`
- Register: `builder.Services.AddScoped<IShipmentService, ShipmentServiceServer>();`
- After `app.MapAdditionalIdentityEndpoints();`, add API endpoints:

```csharp
// Shipment API endpoints
var shipments = app.MapGroup("api/shipments").RequireAuthorization();

shipments.MapGet("/", async (IShipmentService service) =>
    Results.Ok(await service.GetAllShipmentsAsync()));

shipments.MapGet("/track/{trackingNumber}", async (string trackingNumber, IShipmentService service) =>
{
    var shipment = await service.GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(trackingNumber);
    return shipment is null ? Results.NotFound() : Results.Ok(shipment);
}).AllowAnonymous();

shipments.MapPut("/{id}/status", async (int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus, IShipmentService service) =>
{
    var shipment = await service.UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(id, newStatus);
    return shipment is null ? Results.NotFound() : Results.Ok(shipment);
});
```

Note: The tracking endpoint is AllowAnonymous so customers can check without logging in.

### 9. Create Pages in Client project

**Replace `ShipmentTracker.Client/Pages/Home.razor`** with:
```razor
@page "/"
@using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services
@using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models
@inject IShipmentService ShipmentService
@inject NavigationManager Navigation

<PageTitle>ShipmentTracker - Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Shipment Tracker</h1>
<p class="lead">Track your shipments in real time.</p>

<div class="card mt-4">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">Track a Shipment</h5>
        <div class="input-group">
            <input type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="Enter tracking number..."
                   @bind="trackingNumber" @bind:event="oninput"
                   @onkeydown="HandleKeyDown" />
            <button class="btn btn-primary" @onclick="TrackShipment" disabled="@string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(trackingNumber)">
                Track
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<AuthorizeView>
    <Authorized>
        <div class="mt-4">
            <a href="shipments" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">View All Shipments (Dispatch)</a>
        </div>
    </Authorized>
</AuthorizeView>

@code {
    private string trackingNumber = string.Empty;

    private void TrackShipment()
    {
        if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(trackingNumber))
        {
            Navigation.NavigateTo($"track/{trackingNumber.Trim()}");
        }
    }

    private void HandleKeyDown(KeyboardEventArgs e)
    {
        if (e.Key == "Enter") TrackShipment();
    }
}
```

**Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Pages/Track.razor`**:
```razor
@page "/track/{TrackingNumber}"
@using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services
@using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models
@inject IShipmentService ShipmentService

<PageTitle>Track Shipment - @TrackingNumber</PageTitle>

<h2>Shipment Tracking</h2>

@if (loading)
{
    <p><em>Loading...</em></p>
}
else if (shipment is null)
{
    <div class="alert alert-warning">
        <strong>Not found.</strong> No shipment matches tracking number <code>@TrackingNumber</code>.
    </div>
}
else
{
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
            <strong>@shipment.TrackingNumber</strong> — @shipment.Description
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <dl class="row mb-0">
                <dt class="col-sm-4">Status</dt>
                <dd class="col-sm-8"><span class="badge @GetStatusBadgeClass(shipment.Status)">@shipment.Status</span></dd>

                <dt class="col-sm-4">Origin</dt>
                <dd class="col-sm-8">@shipment.Origin</dd>

                <dt class="col-sm-4">Destination</dt>
                <dd class="col-sm-8">@shipment.Destination</dd>

                <dt class="col-sm-4">Shipped On</dt>
                <dd class="col-sm-8">@shipment.CreatedAt.ToString("MMM dd, yyyy")</dd>

                <dt class="col-sm-4">Estimated Delivery</dt>
                <dd class="col-sm-8">
                    @if (shipment.EstimatedDelivery.HasValue)
                    {
                        @shipment.EstimatedDelivery.Value.ToString("MMM dd, yyyy")
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <span class="text-muted">TBD</span>
                    }
                </dd>
            </dl>
        </div>
    </div>
}

<div class="mt-3">
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">← Back</a>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter] public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    private Shipment? shipment;
    private bool loading = true;

    protected override async Task OnParametersSetAsync()
    {
        loading = true;
        shipment = await ShipmentService.GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(TrackingNumber);
